<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Culture in AI Perception Survey</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our Culture in AI Perception Survey was administered via Google Forms and distributed via social media. Participants data was anonymized and a total of 81 participants responded. All participants consented to their answers being analyzed and used in aggregated form for research purposes. We collect voluntarily answered demographic information. In <a href="#A4.T9" title="In Appendix D Culture in AI Perception Survey ‣ The Culture Funnel: You Can’t Align What isn’t in the Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> are the regional breakdowns that participants belong to for those who wished to answer demographic based questions.</p>
</div>
